Row 3 (Communication): [1,1,0,0,1,1] - interacts with Structure, Power, Payloads, On-Board
Row 4 (Attitude Control): [1,1,0,1,1,1] - interacts with Structure, Power, On-Board, Payloads
Row 5 (Payloads): [1,1,1,1,1,1]
